## Overview
This pull request enhances the EcoChroniclez platform by improving the user experience, architecture, and overall functionality while maintaining full compatibility with the Firebase Spark (Free) Plan.

## Changes Made
- Redesigned the UI with an eco-friendly green theme and improved responsiveness.
- Added dark/light mode support.
- Implemented a unified authentication flow with Student and Mentor portals.
- Expanded multilingual support.
- Improved quiz experience, XP system, badges, and leaderboard.
- Enhanced Teacher/Mentor Dashboard analytics.
- Improved Daily Eco Challenges and Waste Identification modules.
- Refactored JavaScript into modular ES6 components.
- Optimized Firebase Firestore integration and removed duplicate initialization.
- Improved error handling, performance, and code maintainability.

## Firebase Compatibility
-  Firebase Hosting
-  Firebase Firestore
-  No Firebase Storage
-  No Cloud Functions
-  No Firebase Authentication
-  No paid Firebase or external AI services

## Testing
- Verified Firebase deployment.
- Tested student and mentor workflows.
- Verified Firestore read/write operations.
- Confirmed responsive UI across desktop and mobile.
- Ensured zero console errors during execution.

This update improves usability, scalability, and maintainability while keeping the project fully deployable on the Firebase Spark (Free) Plan.
